       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The task is to place an order for specific quantities and types of paper products with a delivery date of </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">April 15, 2025. I need to specify the requirements in detail including the quantities, product descriptions, and </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">delivery deadline. I will use the order_agent to handle the confirmed order fulfillment including stock validation </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">and recording the order.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">task_description = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Place an order for 500 sheets of high-quality, recycled cardstock in various colors \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                         </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"for reception use, along with 250 sheets of A4 size printer paper. The order must be \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"delivered by April 15, 2025.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">additional_arguments = {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"order_details\": {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">        \"items\": [</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">            {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                \"product\": \"high-quality recycled cardstock\",</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                \"quantity\": 500,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                \"description\": \"various colors, sheet format\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">            },</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">            {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                \"product\": \"A4 printer paper\",</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                \"quantity\": 250,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                \"description\": \"standard size\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">            }</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">        ],</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                         </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">        \"delivery_date\": \"2025-04-15\",</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">        \"request_date\": \"2025-04-05\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    }</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">order_response = order_agent(task=task_description, additional_args=additional_arguments)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(order_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
