       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">I will provide this summary as the final answer.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_message = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Regarding your order for exhibition supplies due April 15, 2025:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Large poster paper (24x36 inches) is in stock with sufficient quantity (699 units) and can be supplied.\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Glossy A4 paper, matte A3 paper, and heavyweight cardstock are currently not found in the inventory catalog </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">and thus unavailable for order or restocking.\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please consider verifying product names or sourcing these missing items from alternative suppliers to meet </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">your needs.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_answer(final_message)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
