       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The internal catalog does not have the requested paper supplies, so a direct quote cannot be provided from</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">our inventory or pricing system. The large order requires external sourcing from vendors or wholesalers </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">specializing in paper products. This means we should proceed by informing the user about this situation and </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">recommend contacting external suppliers promptly to meet the urgent delivery date.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">response_message = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"The requested items (10,000 sheets of A4 white paper, 5,000 sheets of A3 colored paper in assorted colors, and</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"500 reams of cardboard for signage) are not available in our current catalog or historical quotes. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Therefore, a detailed price and availability quote cannot be provided directly from our system. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"For this large order, we recommend contacting external vendors or wholesalers specializing in paper products \"</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"to obtain competitive quotes and ensure timely delivery by April 15, 2025. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please let us know if you need assistance in sourcing from third-party suppliers or alternative product </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">options.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_answer(response_message)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
