       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">suggestion to source them through an external procurement process.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_answer(</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"The requested paper supplies are not currently in the inventory catalog, so neither orders nor restocking can </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">be done through the system. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please advise if you want me to assist with adding these items to the inventory catalog, or if you prefer to </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">handle procurement externally. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"I can also help find alternative catalog items if desired.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
